RES osdtriplet
! Glass catalogs are AGF files (Library/LIBGLA, plus LIBGLA/ in each
! search-path folder -- this test's TESTCAT.AGF lives in test/data/LIBGLA)
GLASSP
GLASSP RADHARD
GLASSP TESTCAT
! glass data by name, by glass code, and searched in every catalog
GLASSP SCH2000 N-BK7
GLASSP OHARA 497811
GLASSP GLAK ZSILICON
! catalog glasses on a lens: user catalog, a name without a catalog (the
! catalogs after catalog-order.txt follow alphabetically), lower case, and
! an old Ohara name that used to contain a space
GLA S1 N-BK7_SCH2000
GLA S3 ZBK7_TESTCAT
GLA S5 zbk7
RTG ALL
GLA S3 S-FSL5_OHARA
GLA S5 i-fpl51y
RTG ALL
! out of the glass's wavelength range -> warning, indices 1.0
GLA S3 ZNARROW_TESTCAT
RTG ALL
! Herzberger formula against the built-in SPECIAL formulas, in the IR
WL 2000 3000 4000
GLA S1 SILICON
GLA S3 ZSILICON_TESTCAT
RTG ALL
GLA S1 DIAMOND
GLA S3 ZDIAMOND_TESTCAT
RTG ALL
! closest catalog glasses to a model glass
RES osdtriplet
GLA S3 1.5168:64.17
FINDGLAS SCH2000 3 4
FINDGLAS 3 3
FINDGLAS NOCAT 3 3
